# PL/I: IBM Enterprise PL/I for z/OS Language Reference; requirements/languages/pli.md
name     pli pl1
keyword  PROCEDURE PROC END DECLARE DCL IF THEN ELSE DO WHILE UNTIL TO BY SELECT WHEN OTHERWISE CALL
keyword  RETURN RETURNS GO GOTO PUT GET SKIP LIST EDIT DATA BEGIN ON OPTIONS MAIN INIT STOP
type     FIXED FLOAT BINARY DECIMAL CHARACTER CHAR BIT VARYING POINTER
builtin  SUBSTR LENGTH INDEX TRIM MOD ABS SYSPRINT
fold-case
block-comment  /* */
string   ' '  : doubled
string   " "  : doubled
operators  +-*/=<>|&^;:(),.
